      "role": "user",
      "content": "The \"urban-friendly\" one is a good start, but it's still a bit generic. To really make it land with that specific demographic, I want it to sound more authentic. Can you make the second version use more slang or a specific dialect—like AAVE or more \"street\" language? We want them to feel like the agent actually \"gets\" them and isn't just some corporate robot.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
